CC   -!- SUBUNIT: Forms a heterodimer with envelope glycoprotein E1. Interacts
CC       with host CD81 and SCARB1 receptors; these interactions play a role in
CC       viral entry into host cell. Interacts with host EIF2AK2/PKR; this
CC       interaction inhibits EIF2AK2 and probably allows the virus to evade the
CC       innate immune response. Interacts with host CD209/DC-SIGN and
CC       CLEC4M/DC-SIGNR. Interact with host SPCS1; this interaction is
CC       essential for viral particle assembly. Interacts with protease NS2. The
CC       heterodimer E1/E2 interacts with host CLDN1; this interaction plays a
CC       role in viral entry into host cell. Part of the viral assembly
CC       initiation complex composed of NS2, E1, E2, NS3, NS4A, NS5A and the
CC       mature core protein. Interacts with host SLC3A2/4F2hc; the interaction
CC       may facilitate viral entry into host cell. Interacts with human PLSCR1.
CC       {ECO:0000256|ARBA:ARBA00064487}.
CC   -!- SUBUNIT: Homodimer. Interacts with host SPCS1; this interaction is
CC       essential for viral particle assembly. Interacts with envelope
CC       glycoprotein E1. Interacts with envelope glycoprotein E2. Interacts
CC       with viroporin p7. Interacts with serine protease/helicase NS3. Part of
CC       the replication complex composed of NS2, NS3, NS4A, NS4B, NS5A and the
CC       RNA-directed RNA polymerase embedded in an ER-derived membranous web.
CC       Part of the viral assembly initiation complex composed of NS2, E1, E2,
CC       NS3, NS4A, NS5A and the mature core protein.
CC       {ECO:0000256|ARBA:ARBA00062671}.
CC   -!- SUBUNIT: Homohexamer. Homoheptamer. Interacts with protease NS2.
CC       {ECO:0000256|ARBA:ARBA00046771}.
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Host cell membrane
CC       {ECO:0000256|ARBA:ARBA00004165}. Host cytoplasm, host perinuclear
CC       region {ECO:0000256|ARBA:ARBA00004407}. Host endoplasmic reticulum
CC       membrane {ECO:0000256|ARBA:ARBA00004153}; Multi-pass membrane protein
CC       {ECO:0000256|ARBA:ARBA00004153}. Host endoplasmic reticulum membrane
CC       {ECO:0000256|ARBA:ARBA00004291}; Peripheral membrane protein
